OL,3,AAlaska Senate candidate denies knowing
OL,4,Aabout alleged plot to put two Dan
OL,5,ASullivans on ballot
OL,6,
OL,7,FDan S Sullivan, the incumbent
OL,8,FRepublican senator running for
OL,9,Fre-election, and allies have accused
OL,10,Fthe Democrats of trying to confuse
OL,11,Fvoters.
OL,13,FThe Alaska race is considered by
OL,14,Fanalysts to be one of the tightest of
OL,15,Fthe upcoming US midterm elections,
OL,16,Fwhich will decide which party controls
OL,17,FCongress.
